1
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,640
<Default>♪</Default>

2
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,480
<Default>[NARRATOR]
The Dragon Balls.</Default>

3
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:19,480
<Default>When these seven
magic orbs are gathered,</Default>

4
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,860
<Default>and a password spoken aloud,</Default>

5
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:24,730
<Default>the eternal dragon
Shenron appears</Default>

6
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,940
<Default>to grant the summoner's wishes.</Default>

7
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:28,150
<Default>♪</Default>

8
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:31,030
<Default>So long as it is within
his vast power,</Default>

9
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:33,450
<Default>he will fulfill them
without fail.</Default>

10
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:37,960
<Default>This man, Goku,
despite his gentle demeanor,</Default>

11
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:40,120
<Default>is Earth's greatest warrior.</Default>

12
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:43,290
<Default>Protecting our planet
with his superhuman strength.</Default>

13
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,750
<Default>♪</Default>

14
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:47,460
<Default>Leaving his childhood home
in the mountains.</Default>

15
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:49,760
<Default>Goku would go on
to travel the world</Default>

16
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,720
<Default>in search of the Dragon Balls,</Default>

17
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:54,260
<Default>meeting countless friends
on his adventures</Default>

18
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:56,390
<Default>as he grew to adulthood.</Default>

19
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:59,770
<Default>One day, Earth
was invaded by the vicious,</Default>

20
00:00:59,850 --> 00:01:03,110
<Default>spacefaring warrior race
known as Saiyans.</Default>

21
00:01:03,190 --> 00:01:06,980
<Default>And as he defended his home,
Goku learned a shocking truth.</Default>

22
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:08,900
<Default>He was sent to Earth
as an infant</Default>

23
00:01:08,990 --> 00:01:11,200
<Default>to spearhead the
Saiyan conquest.</Default>

24
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:14,030
<Default>♪</Default>

25
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:16,660
<Default>Like all Saiyans,
his body will retain</Default>

26
00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:19,120
<Default>the vigor of youth
for much of his life.</Default>

27
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,080
<Default>Even now...</Default>

28
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:23,830
<Default>he continues to face
terrifying foes,</Default>

29
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,880
<Default>growing stronger in battle.</Default>

30
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:29,050
<Default>Standing alongside
his former rivals.</Default>

31
00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:32,970
<Default>Goku remains
Earth's mightiest protector</Default>

32
00:01:33,050 --> 00:01:34,550
<Default>against evil!</Default>

33
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,310
<Default>♪</Default>

34
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,770
<Default>♪</Default>

35
00:01:41,850 --> 00:01:43,150
<Default>Once again,</Default>

36
00:01:43,230 --> 00:01:46,770
<Default>the Earth is faced
with a deadly new threat.</Default>

37
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:51,570
<Default>CONSPIRACY</Default>

38
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,740
<Default>[thunder rumbling]</Default>

39
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:59,370
<Default>[rain splattering]</Default>

40
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:26,360
<Default>♪</Default>

41
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:39,120
<Default>♪</Default>

42
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:42,290
<Default>[GOMAH]
Curse you, Babidi!</Default>

43
00:02:42,370 --> 00:02:44,290
<Default>That crafty little scoundrel.</Default>

44
00:02:44,370 --> 00:02:47,790
<Default>To think he would use
King Dabura.</Default>

45
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,960
<Default>[DEGESU] It's only natural
that Babidi would seek</Default>

46
00:02:50,050 --> 00:02:52,670
<Default>to manipulate the Demon King
with his magic.</Default>

47
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:56,890
<Default>But for Dabura to allow it?
Frankly, it's disgraceful.</Default>

48
00:02:56,970 --> 00:02:58,220
<Default>[GOMAH]
Hm?</Default>

49
00:02:58,300 --> 00:02:59,970
<Default>♪</Default>

50
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:05,190
<Default>So Dabura.</Default>

51
00:03:05,270 --> 00:03:07,400
<Default>Is he crazy strong
or something?</Default>

52
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:09,020
<Default>[SUPREME KAI]
More than you can imagine.</Default>

53
00:03:09,110 --> 00:03:12,360
<Default>One does not become King
of the Demon World otherwise.</Default>

54
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:14,570
<Default>Back up.
There's an actual Demon World.</Default>

55
00:03:14,650 --> 00:03:16,780
<Default>And it has a king,
and he's right down there?</Default>

56
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:19,070
<Default>Exactly.</Default>

57
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:21,200
<Default>How unexpected!</Default>

58
00:03:21,290 --> 00:03:24,580
<Default>Look, it's your
older brother, Degesu.</Default>

59
00:03:24,660 --> 00:03:25,910
<Default>[grunts]</Default>

60
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,170
<Default>[DEGESU]
Yes, it is.</Default>

61
00:03:27,250 --> 00:03:29,210
<Default>And he's as nosy as ever.</Default>

62
00:03:29,290 --> 00:03:32,000
<Default>Being Supreme Kai has gone
straight to his head.</Default>

63
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:34,970
<Default>But even for him,
helping mortals fight</Default>

64
00:03:35,050 --> 00:03:36,510
<Default>is beyond the pale.</Default>

65
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:39,260
<Default>[GOMAH] In any case,
let's look a bit further ahead.</Default>

66
00:03:44,180 --> 00:03:45,640
<Default>[chuckles]</Default>

67
00:03:45,730 --> 00:03:46,730
<Default>[explosion]</Default>

68
00:03:46,810 --> 00:03:48,150
<Default>[gasps]
Vegeta!</Default>

69
00:03:48,230 --> 00:03:49,690
<Default>[grunting]</Default>

70
00:03:51,270 --> 00:03:52,730
<Default>[whimpering]</Default>

71
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,030
<Default>What madness is this?</Default>

72
00:03:55,110 --> 00:03:57,200
<Default>These are mortals from
the outside world, aren't they?</Default>

73
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,660
<Default>So, how could they be
so powerful?</Default>

74
00:03:59,740 --> 00:04:01,620
<Default>Do you suppose
they could be Majin?</Default>

75
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,660
<Default>[groans]</Default>

76
00:04:04,490 --> 00:04:05,830
<Default>[growls]</Default>

77
00:04:05,910 --> 00:04:07,540
<Default>[grunting]</Default>

78
00:04:09,290 --> 00:04:10,670
<Default>[GOMAH]
Not possible.</Default>

79
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:12,420
<Default>Look closely.</Default>

80
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:14,840
<Default>Their ears are round.</Default>

81
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:17,050
<Default>[DEGESU]
Yes, but they can fly.</Default>

82
00:04:18,090 --> 00:04:19,180
<Default>[roaring]</Default>

83
00:04:19,260 --> 00:04:20,680
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

84
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:23,060
<Default>Furthermore,
they're able to fire</Default>

85
00:04:23,140 --> 00:04:24,640
<Default>bursts of energy
from their hands.</Default>

86
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:27,890
<Default>And it appears
they can use magic.</Default>

87
00:04:27,980 --> 00:04:29,770
<Default>[hissing]</Default>

88
00:04:34,610 --> 00:04:35,650
<Default>It's happening.</Default>

89
00:04:35,730 --> 00:04:37,860
<Default>Buu is finally
coming back to life!</Default>

90
00:04:37,950 --> 00:04:39,820
<Default>♪</Default>

91
00:04:42,740 --> 00:04:44,620
<Default>[all gasping]</Default>

92
00:04:44,700 --> 00:04:46,580
<Default>Buu!</Default>

93
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:51,790
<Default>[groans]
Babidi actually revived Buu?</Default>

94
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:52,960
<Default>[Gomah scoffs]</Default>

95
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,460
<Default>[growls]</Default>

96
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:56,920
<Default>And with Buu at his side,</Default>

97
00:04:57,010 --> 00:04:59,090
<Default>he wouldn't stop
with the outside world.</Default>

98
00:04:59,170 --> 00:05:01,050
<Default>He intends to rule
the Demon Realm</Default>

99
00:05:01,130 --> 00:05:03,970
<Default>-and every other!
-[growling]</Default>

100
00:05:04,050 --> 00:05:05,350
<Default>You hurt Buu.</Default>

101
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:07,020
<Default>Now Buu eat you.</Default>

102
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:08,980
<Default>[growling]</Default>

103
00:05:09,060 --> 00:05:10,350
<Default>Ah!</Default>

104
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:12,600
<Default>[chomping]</Default>

105
00:05:12,690 --> 00:05:14,270
<Default>[both gasp]</Default>

106
00:05:15,230 --> 00:05:16,860
<Default>[whimpering]</Default>

107
00:05:18,650 --> 00:05:19,860
<Default>Did he...</Default>

108
00:05:19,950 --> 00:05:21,610
<Default>Did he just eat Dabura?</Default>

109
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,870
<Default>Like it was nothing?</Default>

110
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:25,530
<Default>[sighs]</Default>

111
00:05:25,620 --> 00:05:27,410
<Default>With Dabura's untimely passing,</Default>

112
00:05:27,490 --> 00:05:30,160
<Default>you became king
of the Demon Realm!</Default>

113
00:05:30,250 --> 00:05:31,420
<Default>[Gomah gasps]</Default>

114
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:34,080
<Default>[laughs]</Default>

115
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:35,540
<Default>[groans]</Default>

116
00:05:35,630 --> 00:05:37,170
<Default>No, no, no, no, no, no!</Default>

117
00:05:37,250 --> 00:05:38,550
<Default>[GOMAH]
This is nothing to celebrate.</Default>

118
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:40,880
<Default>Babidi has Majin Buu
on his side.</Default>

119
00:05:40,970 --> 00:05:43,840
<Default>And next, he'll be turning
that power on us!</Default>

120
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,220
<Default>[DEGESU]
So he will.</Default>

121
00:05:47,930 --> 00:05:49,220
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

122
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:50,310
<Default>[DEGESU]
Lord Gomah!</Default>

123
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:51,980
<Default>That one who just appeared.</Default>

124
00:05:52,060 --> 00:05:53,060
<Default>Isn't he a Namekian?</Default>

125
00:05:53,150 --> 00:05:54,150
<Default>[GOMAH]
Hm?</Default>

126
00:05:54,230 --> 00:05:57,320
<Default>Uh, looks that way,
now that you mention it.</Default>

127
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:59,530
<Default>♪</Default>

128
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,530
<Default>[growls]</Default>

129
00:06:03,610 --> 00:06:05,200
<Default>[whimpering]</Default>

130
00:06:06,530 --> 00:06:08,990
<Default>[roaring]</Default>

131
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:13,460
<Default>[screaming]</Default>

132
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:16,250
<Default>They really did it.</Default>

133
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:17,670
<Default>They defeated Buu!</Default>

134
00:06:17,750 --> 00:06:19,760
<Default>Hmm.
Did they, though?</Default>

135
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,170
<Default>♪</Default>

136
00:06:22,130 --> 00:06:23,720
<Default>[BUU]
Aah-ha!</Default>

137
00:06:25,140 --> 00:06:27,300
<Default>[Buu chuckles]</Default>

138
00:06:27,390 --> 00:06:28,390
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

139
00:06:28,470 --> 00:06:31,230
<Default>[scoffs]
I didn't buy it for a second.</Default>

140
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:33,020
<Default>♪</Default>

141
00:06:33,890 --> 00:06:36,810
<Default>[GOMAH] Hey,
suddenly the sky went dark!</Default>

142
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:38,440
<Default>[DEGESU]
What could that mean?</Default>

143
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:39,940
<Default>Hm?</Default>

144
00:06:40,030 --> 00:06:41,190
<Default>[GOMAH]
There's no way.</Default>

145
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,610
<Default>♪</Default>

146
00:06:44,570 --> 00:06:45,570
<Default>That's it!</Default>

147
00:06:45,660 --> 00:06:47,530
<Default>There's our explanation!</Default>

148
00:06:47,620 --> 00:06:48,700
<Default>Look!</Default>

149
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:49,910
<Default>There they are.</Default>

150
00:06:49,990 --> 00:06:51,410
<Default>The Dragon Balls!</Default>

151
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,790
<Default>[DEGESU]
What? Where?</Default>

152
00:06:52,870 --> 00:06:53,870
<Default>[GOMAH]
Right there!</Default>

153
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,830
<Default>They're the little things
gathered on the ground,</Default>

154
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,210
<Default>the ball-shaped ones!</Default>

155
00:06:57,290 --> 00:06:59,040
<Default>They may be smaller
than we expected,</Default>

156
00:06:59,130 --> 00:07:00,880
<Default>but they're surely
Dragon Balls!</Default>

157
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:02,630
<Default>[DEGESU]
One, two, three.</Default>

158
00:07:02,710 --> 00:07:03,800
<Default>There are seven of them.</Default>

159
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:04,930
<Default>Could that be right?</Default>

160
00:07:05,010 --> 00:07:07,090
<Default>The Earth has a set
of seven Dragon Balls?</Default>

161
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:08,470
<Default>♪</Default>

162
00:07:08,550 --> 00:07:09,560
<Default>Hold on.</Default>

163
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,060
<Default>I've read about Porunga.</Default>

164
00:07:11,140 --> 00:07:12,850
<Default>But this looks
totally different.</Default>

165
00:07:12,930 --> 00:07:15,100
<Default>[GOMAH] Maybe we
skipped over something.</Default>

166
00:07:15,190 --> 00:07:16,770
<Default>♪</Default>

167
00:07:17,860 --> 00:07:19,980
<Default>Now, come forth, Shenron!</Default>

168
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,280
<Default>♪</Default>

169
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,990
<Default>So it's not Porunga.</Default>

170
00:07:23,070 --> 00:07:25,150
<Default>They call this one Shenron!</Default>

171
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:27,820
<Default>[GOMAH] They're acting
quite casual about it all.</Default>

172
00:07:27,910 --> 00:07:30,830
<Default>It would seem that Dragon Balls
are relatively easy</Default>

173
00:07:30,910 --> 00:07:32,160
<Default>to gather on Earth.</Default>

174
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,330
<Default>♪</Default>

175
00:07:33,410 --> 00:07:36,120
<Default>[SHENRON]
I will grant you three wishes.</Default>

176
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:41,300
<Default>Speak, that I may return
to my slumber.</Default>

177
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:42,590
<Default>[both gasp]</Default>

178
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:43,960
<Default>Three wishes?</Default>

179
00:07:44,050 --> 00:07:45,550
<Default>I'm sure I heard that right.</Default>

180
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:47,720
<Default>Shenron can grant three wishes!</Default>

181
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,390
<Default>Now that is a big deal.</Default>

182
00:07:50,470 --> 00:07:52,600
<Default>Wait, we missed something.</Default>

183
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,060
<Default>[GOMAH]
What happened with Buu?</Default>

184
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:58,270
<Default>Buu no need you,
mean old wizard.</Default>

185
00:07:58,350 --> 00:08:00,360
<Default>[whimpering]</Default>

186
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:01,980
<Default>You die, dummy!</Default>

187
00:08:02,070 --> 00:08:03,650
<Default>[growls]</Default>

188
00:08:03,730 --> 00:08:05,190
<Default>[growling]</Default>

189
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:06,610
<Default>[explosion]</Default>

190
00:08:06,700 --> 00:08:07,950
<Default>Babidi's dead!</Default>

191
00:08:08,030 --> 00:08:10,530
<Default>He unleashed Buu's power,
and Buu killed him for it!</Default>

192
00:08:11,370 --> 00:08:12,410
<Default>[laughs]</Default>

193
00:08:12,490 --> 00:08:14,490
<Default>That's what you get, you fool!</Default>

194
00:08:14,580 --> 00:08:17,000
<Default>[Gomah laughs]</Default>

195
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,170
<Default>[GOMAH]
Oh, ah. Uh?</Default>

196
00:08:23,250 --> 00:08:25,380
<Default>-[GOMAH] Ohh!
-We lost him?</Default>

197
00:08:25,460 --> 00:08:26,670
<Default>Where'd he go?</Default>

198
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,510
<Default>♪</Default>

199
00:08:29,090 --> 00:08:30,680
<Default>[DEGESU] [gasps]
Look there!</Default>

200
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,140
<Default>It's another Namekian!</Default>

201
00:08:33,140 --> 00:08:35,140
<Default>Yeah, no mistaking it!</Default>

202
00:08:35,220 --> 00:08:37,850
<Default>Suddenly, it makes sense we
were never able to find them.</Default>

203
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:40,980
<Default>Somehow, they must have escaped
to the outside world.</Default>

204
00:08:41,060 --> 00:08:43,400
<Default>[GOMAH] Whoa,
Buu looks totally different.</Default>

205
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:45,280
<Default>[DEGESU]
Yes.</Default>

206
00:08:46,110 --> 00:08:48,700
<Default>And the transformation
made him more powerful.</Default>

207
00:08:48,780 --> 00:08:50,700
<Default>[rumbling]</Default>

208
00:08:50,780 --> 00:08:52,030
<Default>[grunting]</Default>

209
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,490
<Default>[GOTENKS]
Die Die Missile Barrage!</Default>

210
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,250
<Default>[rumbling]</Default>

211
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,870
<Default>[grunting]</Default>

212
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,250
<Default>[roaring]</Default>

213
00:09:00,330 --> 00:09:01,460
<Default>[grunts]</Default>

214
00:09:01,540 --> 00:09:04,090
<Default>Earth is supposed to be
populated by normal humans.</Default>

215
00:09:04,170 --> 00:09:05,920
<Default>Why are they so strong?</Default>

216
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,840
<Default>♪</Default>

217
00:09:22,310 --> 00:09:23,440
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

218
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:24,820
<Default>This is it!</Default>

219
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:26,650
<Default>♪</Default>

220
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:30,400
<Default>[grunts]
Take this!</Default>

221
00:09:31,950 --> 00:09:33,950
<Default>[Buu (kid) grunting]</Default>

222
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,080
<Default>Until then.</Default>

223
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,250
<Default>[screaming]</Default>

224
00:09:39,330 --> 00:09:41,710
<Default>[screaming]</Default>

225
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:43,420
<Default>♪</Default>

226
00:09:59,890 --> 00:10:01,640
<Default>[whimpering]</Default>

227
00:10:03,020 --> 00:10:04,150
<Default>[thuds]</Default>

228
00:10:05,230 --> 00:10:06,440
<Default>They really pulled it off.</Default>

229
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:10,280
<Default>These earthlings actually
defeated the great Majin Buu!</Default>

230
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,450
<Default>Ah!</Default>

231
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,450
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

232
00:10:13,530 --> 00:10:16,870
<Default>Then the final obstacle
before you has been removed.</Default>

233
00:10:16,950 --> 00:10:18,200
<Default>Huh?!</Default>

234
00:10:20,330 --> 00:10:21,790
<Default>[laughs]</Default>

235
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,670
<Default>♪</Default>

236
00:10:28,250 --> 00:10:30,010
<Default>With Majin Buu eliminated,</Default>

237
00:10:30,090 --> 00:10:31,840
<Default>you are now the king
of the Demon Realm</Default>

238
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:34,300
<Default>in title and in reality.</Default>

239
00:10:34,380 --> 00:10:37,550
<Default>[DEGESU]
Long may you reign, King Gomah.</Default>

240
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,720
<Default>♪</Default>

241
00:10:38,810 --> 00:10:40,560
<Default>[chuckles]</Default>

242
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:42,520
<Default>[footfall]</Default>

243
00:10:43,690 --> 00:10:45,440
<Default>[laughs]</Default>

244
00:10:49,230 --> 00:10:50,820
<Default>-Uh?
-Ah?</Default>

245
00:10:50,900 --> 00:10:52,990
<Default>[gasps]
Arinsu?</Default>

246
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:55,990
<Default>[ARINSU]
Hello, little brother.</Default>

247
00:10:56,070 --> 00:10:58,200
<Default>Fancy meeting you here.</Default>

248
00:10:58,280 --> 00:11:00,160
<Default>Ahh, Doctor Arinsu.</Default>

249
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:03,120
<Default>And as always,
you look stunning.</Default>

250
00:11:03,210 --> 00:11:04,580
<Default>Kind of you to notice, Sire.</Default>

251
00:11:04,670 --> 00:11:07,000
<Default>[GOMAH] But of course,
how goes the research?</Default>

252
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:10,460
<Default>Quite splendidly,
but that aside.</Default>

253
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:12,920
<Default>[ARINSU] Allow me to extend
my congratulations</Default>

254
00:11:13,010 --> 00:11:14,510
<Default>for finally
ascending the throne</Default>

255
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:16,220
<Default>of the Supreme Demon King.</Default>

256
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:18,100
<Default>[GOMAH] [gasps]
But how did you know?</Default>

257
00:11:18,180 --> 00:11:19,510
<Default>Obviously.</Default>

258
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:21,430
<Default>My dear sister
has been looking on</Default>

259
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:22,850
<Default>from somewhere in secret.</Default>

260
00:11:24,060 --> 00:11:26,940
<Default>It's hardly like King Dabura
to visit the outside world,</Default>

261
00:11:27,020 --> 00:11:29,150
<Default>so what could
have prompted him?</Default>

262
00:11:29,230 --> 00:11:32,030
<Default>[ARINSU] That kernel
of curiosity compelled me.</Default>

263
00:11:32,110 --> 00:11:34,820
<Default>Just as it did the two
of you, am I wrong?</Default>

264
00:11:34,900 --> 00:11:37,570
<Default>Well, I suppose
that's true enough.</Default>

265
00:11:37,660 --> 00:11:40,660
<Default>But you will not
be reaping the benefits!</Default>

266
00:11:40,740 --> 00:11:43,410
<Default>King Dabura blindly showered
you with research funds</Default>

267
00:11:43,500 --> 00:11:44,500
<Default>whenever you asked.</Default>

268
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:46,500
<Default>But, now that
he's a monster's dessert,</Default>

269
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:47,920
<Default>we'll be running
a much tighter ship.</Default>

270
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,540
<Default>Why, if I didn't know better,
I would think you were</Default>

271
00:11:50,630 --> 00:11:53,380
<Default>threatening to slash
the funding for my projects!</Default>

272
00:11:54,210 --> 00:11:55,800
<Default>[GOMAH] We shall see.</Default>

273
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:57,130
<Default>[smirks]</Default>

274
00:11:57,220 --> 00:12:00,050
<Default>You might not want
to do anything hasty.</Default>

275
00:12:00,140 --> 00:12:01,930
<Default>I mean, as we've seen,</Default>

276
00:12:02,010 --> 00:12:03,430
<Default>the warriors
of the outside world</Default>

277
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:05,680
<Default>are strong enough
to defeat the great Majin Buu!</Default>

278
00:12:05,770 --> 00:12:06,770
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

279
00:12:06,850 --> 00:12:09,150
<Default>And if such powerful fighters
were to someday</Default>

280
00:12:09,230 --> 00:12:10,810
<Default>invade the Demon Realm.</Default>

281
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:13,190
<Default>I shudder to think
what would become of us all!</Default>

282
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:15,530
<Default>Hardly a concern.</Default>

283
00:12:15,610 --> 00:12:17,780
<Default>Putting aside the question
of their true power,</Default>

284
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:19,410
<Default>what reason would
these mortals have</Default>

285
00:12:19,490 --> 00:12:22,160
<Default>to risk their lives
by intruding upon our realm?</Default>

286
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,910
<Default>I do hope they agree.</Default>

287
00:12:23,990 --> 00:12:27,830
<Default>Now, by your leave...
King Gomah.</Default>

288
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,460
<Default>♪</Default>

289
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:33,340
<Default>[growls]</Default>

290
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:36,010
<Default>[breathing heavily]</Default>

291
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:41,970
<Default>[GOMAH]
Is this going to be an issue?</Default>

292
00:12:42,050 --> 00:12:43,390
<Default>Sire?</Default>

293
00:12:43,470 --> 00:12:45,680
<Default>If those mortals did see
fit to come here,</Default>

294
00:12:45,770 --> 00:12:47,810
<Default>we would be in trouble,
wouldn't we?</Default>

295
00:12:47,890 --> 00:12:49,560
<Default>Don't let my sister get to you.</Default>

296
00:12:49,650 --> 00:12:51,520
<Default>Her advice is for her benefit.</Default>

297
00:12:51,610 --> 00:12:53,520
<Default>On top of that,
even if they did invade</Default>

298
00:12:53,610 --> 00:12:54,690
<Default>the Demon Realm.</Default>

299
00:12:54,780 --> 00:12:57,610
<Default>They could never reach us
in the Demon King's Palace.</Default>

300
00:12:57,690 --> 00:12:59,780
<Default>[Gomah groans]</Default>

301
00:13:01,450 --> 00:13:02,870
<Default>[rain splattering]</Default>

302
00:13:08,410 --> 00:13:10,670
<Default>Hold that thought.</Default>

303
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:13,590
<Default>What if we use
the Dragon Balls?</Default>

304
00:13:13,670 --> 00:13:14,670
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

305
00:13:14,750 --> 00:13:16,170
<Default>Use the Dragon Balls?</Default>

306
00:13:16,260 --> 00:13:17,460
<Default>Seriously?</Default>

307
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:18,970
<Default>♪</Default>

308
00:13:19,050 --> 00:13:20,590
<Default>[DEGESU] You would have us
challenge the might</Default>

309
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:22,550
<Default>of the Three Tamagami?</Default>

310
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:23,800
<Default>[Gomah groans]</Default>

311
00:13:23,890 --> 00:13:27,060
<Default>Did you think I was talking
about our Dragon Balls?</Default>

312
00:13:27,140 --> 00:13:29,850
<Default>Please, I obviously meant
the compact ones</Default>

313
00:13:29,940 --> 00:13:31,940
<Default>they have on Planet Earth!</Default>

314
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:33,020
<Default>But why Earth?</Default>

315
00:13:33,110 --> 00:13:35,730
<Default>Well, the mortals clearly had
no trouble gathering them.</Default>

316
00:13:35,820 --> 00:13:37,530
<Default>We both saw that for ourselves.</Default>

317
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:39,700
<Default>It was practically a picnic.</Default>

318
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:43,160
<Default>Perhaps that's so, Sire,
but what would you wish for?</Default>

319
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:46,120
<Default>Earth's Dragon Balls appear
to function using White Magic.</Default>

320
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:48,370
<Default>They would surely refuse
the kind of dark wish</Default>

321
00:13:48,450 --> 00:13:50,210
<Default>that could rid us of these
troublesome warriors.</Default>

322
00:13:50,290 --> 00:13:51,290
<Default>[Gomah scoffs]</Default>

323
00:13:51,370 --> 00:13:53,830
<Default>[GOMAH] I put that much
together myself!</Default>

324
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:55,000
<Default>[chuckles]</Default>

325
00:13:57,920 --> 00:14:00,590
<Default>But making them young
isn't dark, right?</Default>

326
00:14:00,670 --> 00:14:01,760
<Default>Huh?</Default>

327
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:04,260
<Default>Don't mortals
consider youth a gift?</Default>

328
00:14:04,340 --> 00:14:06,220
<Default>Rather an ingenious plan.</Default>

329
00:14:06,310 --> 00:14:08,470
<Default>[screaming]
[indistinct chatter]</Default>

330
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:11,350
<Default>Didn't-didn't you just leave?</Default>

331
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:13,730
<Default>[laughs]</Default>

332
00:14:13,810 --> 00:14:16,820
<Default>For what it's worth, I would
consider youth a gift as well.</Default>

333
00:14:16,900 --> 00:14:17,980
<Default>Sire.</Default>

334
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:22,280
<Default>[both gasping]</Default>

335
00:14:24,870 --> 00:14:26,490
<Default>"Making them young," Sire?</Default>

336
00:14:26,580 --> 00:14:28,040
<Default>Yes, that's right.</Default>

337
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:32,040
<Default>We use Earth's Dragon Balls
to transform</Default>

338
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:35,170
<Default>all of their warriors
back to children!</Default>

339
00:14:35,250 --> 00:14:38,250
<Default>Ohh!
Brilliant, I get it now!</Default>

340
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:40,460
<Default>They wouldn't be nearly
so powerful as children!</Default>

341
00:14:40,550 --> 00:14:42,670
<Default>Hm.
That's exactly it!</Default>

342
00:14:43,970 --> 00:14:45,930
<Default>So, what about wish number two?</Default>

343
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:47,100
<Default>♪</Default>

344
00:14:47,180 --> 00:14:48,220
<Default>I got it!</Default>

345
00:14:48,310 --> 00:14:50,060
<Default>We can wish back
the Evil Third Eye!</Default>

346
00:14:50,140 --> 00:14:51,890
<Default>The Evil Third Eye!</Default>

347
00:14:51,980 --> 00:14:55,560
<Default>[DEGESU] You're talking about
the legendary Tertian Oculus?</Default>

348
00:14:55,650 --> 00:14:58,400
<Default>The relic lost during
the reign of Dabura's father,</Default>

349
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,150
<Default>Supreme Demon King Abura?</Default>

350
00:15:00,980 --> 00:15:01,990
<Default>[GOMAH]
Indeed.</Default>

351
00:15:02,070 --> 00:15:04,400
<Default>It is said to grant
unbelievable power</Default>

352
00:15:04,490 --> 00:15:06,160
<Default>when placed upon the forehead.</Default>

353
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:09,330
<Default>Passed from one Demon King
to his successor</Default>

354
00:15:09,410 --> 00:15:10,830
<Default>for countless generations,</Default>

355
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:15,290
<Default>the Evil Third Eye let them
rule with absolute power!</Default>

356
00:15:15,370 --> 00:15:16,380
<Default>I see.</Default>

357
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:17,460
<Default>And if we recovered it,</Default>

358
00:15:17,540 --> 00:15:19,090
<Default>no one in any realm
could hope to challenge you!</Default>

359
00:15:19,170 --> 00:15:20,170
<Default>For sure!</Default>

360
00:15:20,250 --> 00:15:22,340
<Default>That leaves one
more wish to go.</Default>

361
00:15:22,420 --> 00:15:24,010
<Default>Sire, I humbly request</Default>

362
00:15:24,090 --> 00:15:26,760
<Default>that you let me
make use of the third wish.</Default>

363
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,050
<Default>Um...</Default>

364
00:15:28,140 --> 00:15:29,300
<Default>♪</Default>

365
00:15:29,390 --> 00:15:31,060
<Default>Let me think about it.</Default>

366
00:15:31,140 --> 00:15:34,100
<Default>For now I need to deal with
all the coronation rigamarole,</Default>

367
00:15:34,180 --> 00:15:35,810
<Default>not to mention
getting speeches prepared</Default>

368
00:15:35,890 --> 00:15:37,190
<Default>for all three Demon Worlds,</Default>

369
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:39,400
<Default>and trying to win
the favor of the Majin.</Default>

370
00:15:40,230 --> 00:15:41,400
<Default>But the moment
that's sorted out,</Default>

371
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:43,190
<Default>I want to start putting
this plan into motion.</Default>

372
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:44,950
<Default>Have my vessel ready!</Default>

373
00:15:45,030 --> 00:15:46,490
<Default>-Understood, sire.
-[Gomah huffs]</Default>

374
00:15:47,950 --> 00:15:51,580
<Default>[GOMAH] I'd say this is a job
for Neva, the Namekian.</Default>

375
00:15:51,660 --> 00:15:53,660
<Default>No one knows more
about the Dragon Balls.</Default>

376
00:15:53,750 --> 00:15:55,040
<Default>You just have
to help him navigate</Default>

377
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:56,750
<Default>his brain fog now and then.</Default>

378
00:15:57,790 --> 00:15:59,460
<Default>Yes, Sire.</Default>

379
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:01,590
<Default>[footfall]</Default>

380
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:26,570
<Default>[clanking]</Default>

381
00:16:27,650 --> 00:16:30,030
<Default>[growling]</Default>

382
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:32,280
<Default>♪</Default>

383
00:16:34,490 --> 00:16:36,160
<Default>Move it!</Default>

384
00:16:36,250 --> 00:16:37,790
<Default>[sighing]</Default>

385
00:16:37,870 --> 00:16:40,790
<Default>[GOMAH] [scoffs]
You call that moving it?</Default>

386
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:41,880
<Default>Blast it!</Default>

387
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:44,050
<Default>[GOMAH] One of our own
Dragon Balls is right here!</Default>

388
00:16:44,130 --> 00:16:46,510
<Default>But so is one of our
stupid Tamagami.</Default>

389
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:50,340
<Default>[NEVA]
Hey, good work, fella.</Default>

390
00:16:50,430 --> 00:16:51,550
<Default>♪</Default>

391
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:53,510
<Default>[metal creaking]</Default>

392
00:16:54,850 --> 00:16:56,390
<Default>[metal creaking]</Default>

393
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:59,060
<Default>All right, old man,
hurry up and get in!</Default>

394
00:16:59,140 --> 00:17:00,350
<Default>[scoffs]</Default>

395
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,020
<Default>[chuckles]</Default>

396
00:17:02,690 --> 00:17:03,820
<Default>Huh?
Wait!</Default>

397
00:17:03,900 --> 00:17:05,530
<Default>[NEVA]
Now, don't rush me, youngster.</Default>

398
00:17:05,610 --> 00:17:07,240
<Default>[groaning]</Default>

399
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:09,070
<Default>[sniffs]</Default>

400
00:17:09,150 --> 00:17:10,490
<Default>Something reeks back here.</Default>

401
00:17:10,570 --> 00:17:12,160
<Default>When's the last time
you took a shower?</Default>

402
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:13,450
<Default>A shower?</Default>

403
00:17:13,530 --> 00:17:15,490
<Default>Ah, I think I took one</Default>

404
00:17:15,580 --> 00:17:18,410
<Default>after a nasty fall in the mud
some years ago.</Default>

405
00:17:18,500 --> 00:17:19,620
<Default>"Years?"</Default>

406
00:17:19,710 --> 00:17:21,710
<Default>Hey, Degesu, let's trade seats.</Default>

407
00:17:21,790 --> 00:17:23,460
<Default>I'll handle
the piloting, got it?</Default>

408
00:17:23,540 --> 00:17:24,550
<Default>What?</Default>

409
00:17:24,630 --> 00:17:25,630
<Default>[grunting]</Default>

410
00:17:25,710 --> 00:17:27,420
<Default>-[DEGESU]But! Wait, wait, wait.
-[GOMAH] Hurry up!</Default>

411
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:30,510
<Default>[GOMAH] Your king is ordering
you to trade him seats!</Default>

412
00:17:31,220 --> 00:17:32,890
<Default>[screaming]</Default>

413
00:17:32,970 --> 00:17:34,470
<Default>♪</Default>

414
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:37,020
<Default>[NEVA] Anyone want
to tell me where we're going?</Default>

415
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:39,180
<Default>The outside world,
I did tell you.</Default>

416
00:17:39,270 --> 00:17:40,980
<Default>The outside world, huh?</Default>

417
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:42,900
<Default>But you're not supposed
to travel there.</Default>

418
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:45,270
<Default>We took care
of the paperwork already.</Default>

419
00:17:45,360 --> 00:17:46,940
<Default>Oh, you don't say?</Default>

420
00:17:47,860 --> 00:17:49,610
<Default>-Excuse me, driver.
-Hm?</Default>

421
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:52,030
<Default>Could we go back
and grab my toothbrush?</Default>

422
00:17:52,110 --> 00:17:53,740
<Default>It's not a vacation!</Default>

423
00:17:53,820 --> 00:17:55,870
<Default>We're going to talk business
with a young Namekian,</Default>

424
00:17:55,950 --> 00:17:58,160
<Default>and we're turning straight
around when we're done!</Default>

425
00:17:58,250 --> 00:18:00,000
<Default>A Namekian?</Default>

426
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:02,250
<Default>Really!
That sounds lovely.</Default>

427
00:18:02,330 --> 00:18:05,460
<Default>I didn't realize there
were others besides me.</Default>

428
00:18:05,540 --> 00:18:07,630
<Default>[engine whirring]</Default>

429
00:18:09,210 --> 00:18:10,970
<Default>[thunder rumbling]</Default>

430
00:18:14,550 --> 00:18:16,600
<Default>[wind gusting]</Default>

431
00:18:18,930 --> 00:18:21,480
<Default>♪</Default>

432
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:23,770
<Default>Who goes there?</Default>

433
00:18:23,850 --> 00:18:26,440
<Default>Reveal yourself.</Default>

434
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:29,480
<Default>Who goes here is the new
Supreme Demon King Gomah!</Default>

435
00:18:29,570 --> 00:18:32,280
<Default>But feel free to just
call me "King Gomah."</Default>

436
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:35,030
<Default>Congratulations.</Default>

437
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:36,950
<Default>You needn't elaborate.</Default>

438
00:18:37,030 --> 00:18:39,040
<Default>In fact, please don't.</Default>

439
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:43,000
<Default>You need only state
your PIN code.</Default>

440
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,710
<Default>0-4-9-3.</Default>

441
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:46,460
<Default>[SIR WARP]
What?</Default>

442
00:18:46,540 --> 00:18:50,550
<Default>So, you're going
to the outside world, eh?</Default>

443
00:18:51,670 --> 00:18:53,340
<Default>[all sighing]</Default>

444
00:18:54,430 --> 00:18:56,180
<Default>♪</Default>

445
00:18:57,930 --> 00:18:59,850
<Default>Very well, then.</Default>

446
00:18:59,930 --> 00:19:01,520
<Default>I will allow it.</Default>

447
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:02,940
<Default>[Gomah grunts]</Default>

448
00:19:03,020 --> 00:19:04,730
<Default>What, just like that?</Default>

449
00:19:04,810 --> 00:19:08,110
<Default>Ahhh...</Default>

450
00:19:11,900 --> 00:19:14,030
<Default>♪</Default>

451
00:19:18,990 --> 00:19:21,080
<Default>♪</Default>

452
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:23,540
<Default>[creaking]</Default>

453
00:19:25,250 --> 00:19:26,830
<Default>[all gasping]</Default>

454
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,380
<Default>[all screaming]</Default>

455
00:19:38,390 --> 00:19:40,470
<Default>[crackling]</Default>

456
00:19:43,390 --> 00:19:45,060
<Default>Headed to the
outside world, right?</Default>

457
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:46,400
<Default>Which universe do you need?</Default>

458
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,860
<Default>Ah, universe seven.</Default>

459
00:19:47,940 --> 00:19:49,900
<Default>And which number
in universe seven?</Default>

460
00:19:49,980 --> 00:19:50,980
<Default>[DEGESU]
Let's see, ah...</Default>

461
00:19:51,070 --> 00:19:52,360
<Default>which number
is closest to Earth?</Default>

462
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:53,780
<Default>Um...number three.</Default>

463
00:19:53,860 --> 00:19:55,360
<Default>Another one for number three.</Default>

464
00:19:55,450 --> 00:19:57,450
<Default>It's been a popular
destination lately.</Default>

465
00:19:57,530 --> 00:19:58,820
<Default>Wait, it has?</Default>

466
00:19:58,910 --> 00:20:02,910
<Default>Hm...oh, you're talking
about Dabura and Babidi.</Default>

467
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:05,370
<Default>There's also the person
who went in after them.</Default>

468
00:20:05,460 --> 00:20:06,960
<Default>Huh?
Who did?</Default>

469
00:20:07,040 --> 00:20:08,960
<Default>Hey! Gimme names!
Out with it!</Default>

470
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:11,300
<Default>You have no right
to talk to me like that!</Default>

471
00:20:11,380 --> 00:20:13,800
<Default>Oh, do forgive my rudeness.</Default>

472
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:16,590
<Default>Will you please tell me
who followed them?</Default>

473
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:18,050
<Default>Let's see.</Default>

474
00:20:18,140 --> 00:20:19,850
<Default>Pretty sure
it was Doctor Arinsu.</Default>

475
00:20:19,930 --> 00:20:21,430
<Default>-What?
-Huh?</Default>

476
00:20:21,510 --> 00:20:22,970
<Default>[DEGESU]
My sister?</Default>

477
00:20:23,850 --> 00:20:25,810
<Default>But why would she
have done that?</Default>

478
00:20:25,890 --> 00:20:28,650
<Default>Whatever it is, it better not
end up being our problem.</Default>

479
00:20:28,730 --> 00:20:31,400
<Default>This is none of my business!
Hurry up and get out!</Default>

480
00:20:32,270 --> 00:20:33,570
<Default>[GOMAH] If it's
"none of your business,"</Default>

481
00:20:33,650 --> 00:20:34,820
<Default>why bring it up?</Default>

482
00:20:36,530 --> 00:20:38,450
<Default>[engine whirring]</Default>

483
00:20:46,370 --> 00:20:48,620
<Default>[GROUP]
Happy birthday, Trunks!</Default>

484
00:20:48,710 --> 00:20:51,630
<Default>And happy
return-to-existence day, Earth!</Default>

485
00:20:51,710 --> 00:20:52,920
<Default>[blowing]</Default>

486
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,340
<Default>[GROUP]
Cheers!</Default>

487
00:20:54,420 --> 00:20:55,630
<Default>[TRUNKS]
Thanks, everyone!</Default>

488
00:20:55,710 --> 00:20:57,720
<Default>♪</Default>

489
00:20:59,970 --> 00:21:03,100
<Default>Hey, birthday boy,
how many is this now?</Default>

490
00:21:03,180 --> 00:21:04,520
<Default>I'm turning nine!</Default>

491
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:05,930
<Default>Wow, already?</Default>

492
00:21:06,020 --> 00:21:08,390
<Default>Well, the growth spurt's
gotta hit eventually.</Default>

493
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:11,270
<Default>Krillin, you're the last person
I wanna hear that from.</Default>

494
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:13,400
<Default>You're a Saiyan, so you'll
be one of the short kids</Default>

495
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:16,070
<Default>until around 15
when you grow up overnight.</Default>

496
00:21:16,150 --> 00:21:18,610
<Default>That was pretty much how
it went with you, wasn't it?</Default>

497
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:20,110
<Default>[GOKU]
Although, based on your dad,</Default>

498
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:22,620
<Default>you might have less of a growth
spurt than other Saiyans.</Default>

499
00:21:22,700 --> 00:21:25,120
<Default>Are you picking a fight
on my son's birthday?</Default>

500
00:21:25,870 --> 00:21:27,120
<Default>Isn't that...</Default>

501
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:28,750
<Default>Heya, Supreme Kai!</Default>

502
00:21:29,540 --> 00:21:31,750
<Default>I had no idea
you were gonna come!</Default>

503
00:21:31,830 --> 00:21:34,500
<Default>Oh, I had other business
in the neighborhood,</Default>

504
00:21:34,590 --> 00:21:35,880
<Default>so why not?</Default>

505
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:37,260
<Default>Hold on.</Default>

506
00:21:37,340 --> 00:21:40,050
<Default>I thought you and Kibito
did that Potara earring fusion</Default>

507
00:21:40,130 --> 00:21:41,970
<Default>that you can't unfuse from.</Default>

508
00:21:42,050 --> 00:21:44,050
<Default>But you're sitting right there
and there's definitely</Default>

509
00:21:44,140 --> 00:21:46,390
<Default>two of you again,
so what's going on?</Default>

510
00:21:46,470 --> 00:21:48,140
<Default>We have you to thank for that.</Default>

511
00:21:48,230 --> 00:21:50,640
<Default>Remember when you and Vegeta
fused into Vegetto</Default>

512
00:21:50,730 --> 00:21:52,100
<Default>with the Potara earrings?</Default>

513
00:21:52,190 --> 00:21:54,440
<Default>Later on, when you were
absorbed by Majin Buu,</Default>

514
00:21:54,520 --> 00:21:55,820
<Default>you split apart again.</Default>

515
00:21:56,860 --> 00:21:58,780
<Default>That's what gave us the idea.</Default>

516
00:21:58,860 --> 00:22:00,950
<Default>[SUPREME KAI] Now that we're
on better terms with Buu,</Default>

517
00:22:01,030 --> 00:22:02,990
<Default>we just asked him this time.</Default>

518
00:22:03,070 --> 00:22:06,290
<Default>Buu swallow one pink man!
Buu spit out two pink men!</Default>

519
00:22:06,370 --> 00:22:08,870
<Default>His body has
an unusual property.</Default>

520
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:10,910
<Default>It seems to produce
some kind of gas</Default>

521
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,330
<Default>powerful enough to counteract</Default>

522
00:22:12,420 --> 00:22:14,880
<Default>even the magic
of the Potara earrings!</Default>

523
00:22:14,960 --> 00:22:16,750
<Default>Ah, that's kinda cool,</Default>

524
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:18,960
<Default>but did you two not actually
want to be fused</Default>

525
00:22:19,050 --> 00:22:20,510
<Default>that whole time, then?</Default>

526
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:23,390
<Default>It's mostly that
I didn't want to be old.</Default>

527
00:22:23,470 --> 00:22:25,050
<Default>-Hm?
-[chuckles]</Default>

528
00:22:25,140 --> 00:22:26,680
<Default>[KRILLIN] As long
as we've known each other,</Default>

529
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:28,640
<Default>you still surprise me, Goku.</Default>

530
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:30,850
<Default>I can't believe you had
Shenron wipe evil Buu</Default>

531
00:22:30,930 --> 00:22:31,940
<Default>from everyone's memories</Default>

532
00:22:32,020 --> 00:22:34,230
<Default>so good Buu could
keep living on Earth!</Default>

533
00:22:34,310 --> 00:22:36,480
<Default>By the way,
I'm only just noticing</Default>

534
00:22:36,570 --> 00:22:38,610
<Default>that Gohan isn't in attendance.</Default>

535
00:22:38,690 --> 00:22:40,320
<Default>Yeah, he was a no-show.</Default>

536
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:42,030
<Default>He's been kinda distant lately.</Default>

537
00:22:42,950 --> 00:22:44,990
<Default>Says he's got
too much studying to do.</Default>

538
00:22:45,870 --> 00:22:47,830
<Default>[SUPREME KAI] Well, I suppose
fighting for the fate</Default>

539
00:22:47,910 --> 00:22:50,000
<Default>of the Earth had been
imposing on his schedule.</Default>

540
00:22:51,710 --> 00:22:53,920
<Default>Yeah! I'm stuffed.</Default>

541
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:56,170
<Default>I haven't pigged out
like that for ages.</Default>

542
00:22:56,250 --> 00:22:58,500
<Default>Hey, Vegeta,
you up for a quick spar?</Default>

543
00:22:59,210 --> 00:23:01,090
<Default>[scoffs]
As you wish.</Default>

544
00:23:02,050 --> 00:23:03,340
<Default>[chuckles]</Default>

545
00:23:05,720 --> 00:23:07,350
<Default>♪</Default>

546
00:23:10,770 --> 00:23:11,850
<Default>[both grunt]</Default>

547
00:23:11,930 --> 00:23:13,640
<Default>♪</Default>

548
00:23:13,730 --> 00:23:17,020
<Default>Don't look now, but Vegeta
and Goku are fighting again.</Default>

549
00:23:17,110 --> 00:23:18,690
<Default>Okay, I won't look.</Default>

550
00:23:19,570 --> 00:23:21,990
<Default>[grunting]</Default>

551
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:24,570
<Default>Huh?</Default>

552
00:23:25,570 --> 00:23:27,320
<Default>[grunting]</Default>

553
00:23:28,280 --> 00:23:29,370
<Default>[growls]</Default>

554
00:23:30,410 --> 00:23:32,120
<Default>♪</Default>

555
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:35,830
<Default>[growling]</Default>

556
00:23:36,670 --> 00:23:38,380
<Default>♪</Default>

557
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,260
<Default>[growls]</Default>

558
00:23:41,340 --> 00:23:43,550
<Default>[screaming]</Default>

559
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:46,010
<Default>♪</Default>

560
00:23:50,310 --> 00:23:51,680
<Default>[crackling]</Default>

561
00:23:51,770 --> 00:23:53,770
<Default>[growling]</Default>

562
00:23:53,850 --> 00:23:54,940
<Default>Huh?</Default>

563
00:23:55,310 --> 00:23:56,310
<Default>[chuckles]</Default>

564
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:59,360
<Default>If that's how you wanna play.
Let's go!</Default>

565
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:01,400
<Default>[growling]</Default>

566
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:04,490
<Default>♪</Default>

567
00:24:06,410 --> 00:24:08,530
<Default>[roaring]</Default>

568
00:24:11,290 --> 00:24:13,580
<Default>[grunting]</Default>

569
00:24:15,120 --> 00:24:16,750
<Default>[roaring]</Default>

570
00:24:16,830 --> 00:24:17,960
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

571
00:24:21,800 --> 00:24:22,960
<Default>[wind howling]</Default>

572
00:24:23,050 --> 00:24:25,300
<Default>They seem to be
having a good time.</Default>

573
00:24:25,380 --> 00:24:26,880
<Default>Shall we join in the fun?</Default>

574
00:24:26,970 --> 00:24:28,180
<Default>We'd better not.</Default>

575
00:24:28,260 --> 00:24:30,260
<Default>You and I both know
that anything can happen</Default>

576
00:24:30,350 --> 00:24:31,430
<Default>at any time.</Default>

577
00:24:31,510 --> 00:24:33,390
<Default>[crackling]</Default>

578
00:24:34,810 --> 00:24:36,350
<Default>[POPO]
I think it's happening now.</Default>

579
00:24:36,520 --> 00:24:37,600
<Default>[DENDE]
What?</Default>

580
00:24:37,690 --> 00:24:39,190
<Default>[both screaming]</Default>

581
00:24:39,270 --> 00:24:41,270
<Default>[engine whirring]</Default>

582
00:24:43,940 --> 00:24:45,530
<Default>♪</Default>

583
00:24:46,700 --> 00:24:48,570
<Default>[groaning]</Default>

584
00:24:48,660 --> 00:24:50,370
<Default>Well, that was a journey.</Default>

585
00:24:50,450 --> 00:24:51,580
<Default>[GOMAH]
But we're here!</Default>

586
00:24:52,700 --> 00:24:53,910
<Default>[groans]</Default>

587
00:24:53,990 --> 00:24:56,250
<Default>-Huh?
-Who are all of you?</Default>

588
00:24:56,330 --> 00:24:58,000
<Default>Hah!</Default>

589
00:24:58,080 --> 00:25:00,420
<Default>Well, I'll be darned.
You're a Namekian!</Default>

590
00:25:00,500 --> 00:25:02,790
<Default>First I've seen in,
let's see here,</Default>

591
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:04,760
<Default>a couple of thousand years,
at least!</Default>

592
00:25:04,840 --> 00:25:05,960
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

593
00:25:06,050 --> 00:25:07,260
<Default>♪</Default>

594
00:25:07,340 --> 00:25:10,340
<Default>[DENDE]
Are you one of the Supreme Kai?</Default>

595
00:25:10,430 --> 00:25:12,180
<Default>An easy mistake to make.</Default>

596
00:25:12,970 --> 00:25:13,970
<Default>[DEGESU]
But no.</Default>

597
00:25:14,060 --> 00:25:15,850
<Default>We come from the Demon Realm.</Default>

598
00:25:15,930 --> 00:25:17,230
<Default>[Dende gasps]</Default>

599
00:25:17,310 --> 00:25:19,230
<Default>[DEGESU]
As did your Namekian ancestors.</Default>

600
00:25:19,310 --> 00:25:20,560
<Default>Yes?</Default>

601
00:25:20,650 --> 00:25:22,360
<Default>Those pointed ears
are the giveaway.</Default>

602
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:23,520
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

603
00:25:23,610 --> 00:25:26,150
<Default>[DEGESU] Your roots
can be traced to our realm.</Default>

604
00:25:26,240 --> 00:25:27,820
<Default>Step aside!</Default>

605
00:25:27,900 --> 00:25:29,280
<Default>Can I help you?</Default>

606
00:25:29,360 --> 00:25:31,870
<Default>That's exactly
what we're here to find out.</Default>

607
00:25:31,950 --> 00:25:33,160
<Default>Let's make this quick!</Default>

608
00:25:33,240 --> 00:25:34,490
<Default>You're responsible for managing</Default>

609
00:25:34,580 --> 00:25:36,700
<Default>the Dragon Balls
in this world, right?</Default>

610
00:25:36,790 --> 00:25:38,000
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

611
00:25:38,080 --> 00:25:39,830
<Default>If that was a yes,
then gather them</Default>

612
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:41,540
<Default>right here, right now!</Default>

613
00:25:41,630 --> 00:25:43,250
<Default>Gather the Dragon Balls?</Default>

614
00:25:43,340 --> 00:25:45,130
<Default>I can't just do that for you!</Default>

615
00:25:45,210 --> 00:25:47,300
<Default>About the response I expected,</Default>

616
00:25:47,380 --> 00:25:50,380
<Default>which is exactly why
I brought this fossil along.</Default>

617
00:25:50,470 --> 00:25:51,800
<Default>Hey, do it.</Default>

618
00:25:52,590 --> 00:25:54,510
<Default>Do wha...</Default>

619
00:25:54,600 --> 00:25:57,470
<Default>[GOMAH] Do the thing
we talked about before!</Default>

620
00:25:57,560 --> 00:25:58,640
<Default>Fetch the Earth Dragon Balls</Default>

621
00:25:58,730 --> 00:26:00,890
<Default>and I'll add a 1,000 years
onto your life!</Default>

622
00:26:00,980 --> 00:26:02,400
<Default>[NEVA]
Ahh.</Default>

623
00:26:02,480 --> 00:26:04,230
<Default>We did talk about that.</Default>

624
00:26:04,310 --> 00:26:05,770
<Default>[laughs]</Default>

625
00:26:05,860 --> 00:26:07,650
<Default>[wind howling]</Default>

626
00:26:08,610 --> 00:26:10,570
<Default>[DENDE]
Wait, who is he?</Default>

627
00:26:11,450 --> 00:26:14,910
<Default>The Demon Realm has
its own Dragon Balls, you see,</Default>

628
00:26:14,990 --> 00:26:16,870
<Default>and the one who brought them
into existence</Default>

629
00:26:16,950 --> 00:26:19,540
<Default>just so happens
to be that old coot.</Default>

630
00:26:19,620 --> 00:26:20,620
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

631
00:26:20,710 --> 00:26:22,170
<Default>But that's not all.</Default>

632
00:26:22,250 --> 00:26:25,170
<Default>[GOMAH] He also created
the terrifying Tamagami,</Default>

633
00:26:25,250 --> 00:26:28,260
<Default>who stand guard over
our Dragon Balls to this day.</Default>

634
00:26:28,340 --> 00:26:30,970
<Default>And for ages, they've prevented
anyone from assembling them</Default>

635
00:26:31,050 --> 00:26:32,130
<Default>and making a wish.</Default>

636
00:26:33,010 --> 00:26:34,890
<Default>So, when we found out
that Earth had a set,</Default>

637
00:26:34,970 --> 00:26:37,560
<Default>we decided we'd drop in
and borrow yours.</Default>

638
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:39,560
<Default>You would borrow them?</Default>

639
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:41,350
<Default>Then you're trying
to gather our Dragon Balls</Default>

640
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:43,100
<Default>and make a wish to Shenron?</Default>

641
00:26:43,190 --> 00:26:44,940
<Default>[GOMAH]
Duh! Obviously!</Default>

642
00:26:45,610 --> 00:26:47,440
<Default>[Neva groans]</Default>

643
00:26:47,520 --> 00:26:48,780
<Default>♪</Default>

644
00:26:50,860 --> 00:26:52,530
<Default>[Neva groans]</Default>

645
00:26:54,870 --> 00:26:56,450
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

646
00:26:57,910 --> 00:26:59,620
<Default>[NEVA] [sighs]
There we go.</Default>

647
00:27:00,330 --> 00:27:01,750
<Default>Looks like we must've got here</Default>

648
00:27:01,830 --> 00:27:03,370
<Default>straight after someone
made a wish.</Default>

649
00:27:03,460 --> 00:27:05,750
<Default>'Cause right now
they're just a buncha rocks.</Default>

650
00:27:05,830 --> 00:27:07,790
<Default>Welp.
That'll be a pain.</Default>

651
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:09,590
<Default>♪</Default>

652
00:27:14,340 --> 00:27:16,350
<Default>[Neva screaming]</Default>

653
00:27:17,760 --> 00:27:19,560
<Default>♪</Default>

654
00:27:33,070 --> 00:27:34,860
<Default>[rumbling]</Default>

655
00:27:34,950 --> 00:27:37,200
<Default>♪</Default>

656
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:39,490
<Default>What?
How did he...</Default>

657
00:27:39,580 --> 00:27:40,910
<Default>[laughs]</Default>

658
00:27:42,620 --> 00:27:44,830
<Default>One, two, we've got six.</Default>

659
00:27:45,500 --> 00:27:46,630
<Default>That's seven!</Default>

660
00:27:46,710 --> 00:27:48,840
<Default>Great, now what
are we waiting for?</Default>

661
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:50,170
<Default>Neva.</Default>

662
00:27:50,250 --> 00:27:51,920
<Default>You have one more task.</Default>

663
00:27:52,010 --> 00:27:54,630
<Default>Your power will allow you
to restore them early, right?</Default>

664
00:27:54,720 --> 00:27:56,550
<Default>[chuckles]</Default>

665
00:27:59,390 --> 00:28:00,720
<Default>[groans]</Default>

666
00:28:00,810 --> 00:28:02,520
<Default>♪</Default>

667
00:28:06,900 --> 00:28:08,480
<Default>[gasps]</Default>

668
00:28:08,560 --> 00:28:09,650
<Default>Hm.</Default>

669
00:28:09,730 --> 00:28:12,030
<Default>I don't know what it is
you planned to wish for,</Default>

670
00:28:12,110 --> 00:28:13,360
<Default>but you may as well go home,</Default>

671
00:28:13,440 --> 00:28:15,900
<Default>'cause I'd sooner die
than give you the password!</Default>

672
00:28:15,990 --> 00:28:18,320
<Default>[DEGESU] That's fine,
the whole process is on video.</Default>

673
00:28:18,410 --> 00:28:19,660
<Default>We took notes.</Default>

674
00:28:21,790 --> 00:28:24,160
<Default>Come forth.
Shen--</Default>

675
00:28:24,250 --> 00:28:25,960
<Default>Stop!</Default>

676
00:28:26,040 --> 00:28:27,960
<Default>[grunts]</Default>

677
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:29,040
<Default>[thuds]</Default>

678
00:28:29,130 --> 00:28:30,710
<Default>[whimpering]</Default>

679
00:28:30,790 --> 00:28:32,750
<Default>Do you have an objection?</Default>

680
00:28:32,840 --> 00:28:35,050
<Default>Would you care
for a beverage, sir?</Default>

681
00:28:36,430 --> 00:28:37,510
<Default>[DEGESU]
No, thank you.</Default>

682
00:28:38,390 --> 00:28:40,970
<Default>Come forth, Shenron.</Default>

683
00:28:41,050 --> 00:28:44,220
<Default>We summon you
to grant our wishes!</Default>

684
00:28:44,980 --> 00:28:46,350
<Default>♪</Default>

685
00:28:58,910 --> 00:29:00,740
<Default>♪</Default>

686
00:29:00,820 --> 00:29:02,490
<Default>[both gasping]</Default>

687
00:29:05,040 --> 00:29:07,410
<Default>[KRILLIN]
Uh, are we all seeing this?</Default>

688
00:29:07,500 --> 00:29:09,790
<Default>The sky just went pitch black.</Default>

689
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:13,250
<Default>It looks like when somebody
summons Shenron.</Default>

690
00:29:13,340 --> 00:29:15,380
<Default>Yeah, but that can't be right.</Default>

691
00:29:15,460 --> 00:29:18,050
<Default>It should be a while before
the Dragon Balls become usable.</Default>

692
00:29:18,130 --> 00:29:19,220
<Default>Then what else could it be,</Default>

693
00:29:19,300 --> 00:29:21,300
<Default>other than some kinda
surprise eclipse?</Default>

694
00:29:21,390 --> 00:29:22,390
<Default>Man.</Default>

695
00:29:22,470 --> 00:29:25,100
<Default>-Supreme Kai, is this...
-Seems so.</Default>

696
00:29:25,180 --> 00:29:27,600
<Default>-Do you sense it too, Kibito?
-Hm.</Default>

697
00:29:27,680 --> 00:29:29,310
<Default>-It could only be...
-Huh?</Default>

698
00:29:30,600 --> 00:29:33,400
<Default>[SHENRON]
Now, speak your wish.</Default>

699
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:36,150
<Default>I shall grant it
without hesitation.</Default>

700
00:29:36,860 --> 00:29:38,030
<Default>[GOMAH]
Spectacular!</Default>

701
00:29:38,110 --> 00:29:39,360
<Default>Listen carefully.</Default>

702
00:29:39,450 --> 00:29:41,780
<Default>I want you to turn the ones
who defeated Majin Buu,</Default>

703
00:29:41,870 --> 00:29:45,120
<Default>and all their friends,
back into children.</Default>

704
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,330
<Default>Toot sweet!</Default>

705
00:29:46,410 --> 00:29:47,910
<Default>Huh?</Default>

706
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:50,000
<Default>[Shenron groans]</Default>

707
00:29:50,080 --> 00:29:52,080
<Default>[GOMAH]
So? What's wrong?</Default>

708
00:29:52,170 --> 00:29:56,170
<Default>"Children" is too broad
of a term for this purpose.</Default>

709
00:29:56,260 --> 00:29:58,550
<Default>How old are we talking?</Default>

710
00:29:58,630 --> 00:30:00,930
<Default>How old?
Let me think.</Default>

711
00:30:01,010 --> 00:30:03,800
<Default>Don't suppose we could age them
down to first grade?</Default>

712
00:30:03,890 --> 00:30:06,930
<Default>And those
who are already children?</Default>

713
00:30:07,020 --> 00:30:08,600
<Default>Come on, man.</Default>

714
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:09,940
<Default>Uh...</Default>

715
00:30:11,350 --> 00:30:12,980
<Default>Make 'em babies!</Default>

716
00:30:13,060 --> 00:30:14,730
<Default>[Shenron groans]</Default>

717
00:30:14,820 --> 00:30:15,860
<Default>So, what?</Default>

718
00:30:15,940 --> 00:30:18,530
<Default>You said you'd do it
without hesitation, right?</Default>

719
00:30:19,610 --> 00:30:21,280
<Default>[SHENRON]
Very well.</Default>

720
00:30:22,360 --> 00:30:23,740
<Default>[GOMAH]
Hm.</Default>

721
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:27,370
<Default>[glass shattering]</Default>

722
00:30:27,450 --> 00:30:29,200
<Default>♪</Default>

723
00:30:34,880 --> 00:30:36,840
<Default>[screaming]</Default>

724
00:30:40,880 --> 00:30:43,220
<Default>♪</Default>

725
00:30:45,220 --> 00:30:47,510
<Default>[all screaming]</Default>

726
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:49,770
<Default>♪</Default>

727
00:31:56,120 --> 00:31:58,290
<Default>♪</Default>

728
00:31:58,880 --> 00:32:00,250
<Default>GLORIO</Default>

